# Metadata execution scope declared before execution

The only planned local scripts will copy explicitly listed accepted source/instruction files, calculate SHA256/byte identities, extract the exact accepted memory body by interval, save the inspected wrapper diff, verify source freshness and snapshot hashes, and seal this independent directory. They will not import or execute physics programs, compute a Markov fixture, replay a prior runner, read the new candidate/attack memo, query Git or mutate W.

No new scientific diagnostic is necessary: the matrix power, reversible gate exponent, exact-marginal block-matrix spectrum and resource sums have direct analytic derivations in DERIVATION.md. A future candidate comparison must occur only after the independent freeze and must preserve that sealed subtree.
